    "Lives at weekends/<season>/f1_teams_<season>.json.",
    "FALLBACK: any field that is null, \"\" or missing falls back to the live season's value for the team with the same `key`. Reuse a 2026 key (e.g. \"audi\" for Sauber) to inherit; a key with no live match has nothing to fall back to.",
    "key: stable lowercase id (letters/digits). name: display name that year. fullName: official entry name. shortName: 2-3 letter code.",
    "aliases: every spelling of the team in that season's results/standings feeds (matched ignoring case, spaces and punctuation). Fills in only if non-empty.",
    "base: HQ city, country: team nationality, powerUnit: engine supplier that year.",
    "colors.primary / colors.secondary: the two team colours for constructors standings and the dot gradient. onPrimary: text colour on primary. primaryLight / secondaryLight: optional paper-mode overrides.",
    "carUrl: direct link to the side-view car graphic (700:172). null = the app's bundled car art.",
    "icon: bundled asset name. logoUrl / logoLightUrl: optional remote logos (light = for light mode)."
  ],
